# TASK/LDG-M3 run C (the acceptance run, memprot=on and =strict) --
# LDGDEMO.NAP (LDG demo client on WinDom, EX_LIB.NLD + POPUP.NLD loaded at
# start), driven by the scratch IKBD injector. Ticks = hz_200 after the
# client's first poll. Window geometry from probe1-on-t35.png:
#   Compute (236..303, 259..278)  Close (331..400, 259..278)
# IKBD make codes: Alt 38, C 2E, Return 1C, Esc 01, '1' 02, '2' 03, '3' 04;
# break = make | 0x80.
#  1. Alt+C  = WinDom keyboard shortcut of [Compute (frm_keybd_ev.c): with
#     the start-up operation OPE_INFO, compute() shows FormAlert(mathinfo()),
#     mathinfo = EX_LIB.NLD's information() via ldg_find.  Return closes it.
#  2. a LONG mouse press on Compute (0.8 s, longer than the double-click
#     window): the same alert through WinDom's mouse path.
#  3. a SHORT click on Compute: expected to be dropped (evnt_multi reports
#     EV_MB = 0 after the double-click window; finding B1 of the receipt).
#  4. Esc 1 2 3 into the Value field (WinDom frm_keyhd -> objc_edit).
#  5. Return = the DEFAULT object Close: WM_CLOSED -> std_dstry -> AP_TERM
#     -> ApTerm(): ldg_close(popup), ldg_close(math), RsrcFree, ApplExit,
#     exit(0) -> back on the desktop.
100 parkbr
1600 mark S00_WINDOW
2000 key 38
2005 key 2E
2010 key AE
2030 key B8
2400 mark S01_INFO_ALERT_KBD
3200 key 1C
3206 key 9C
3600 mark S02_ALERT_GONE
3700 move 269 268
3800 down
3960 up
4400 mark S03_INFO_ALERT_LONGPRESS
5200 key 1C
5206 key 9C
5600 mark S04_ALERT_GONE2
5700 down
5706 up
6300 mark S05_SHORTCLICK
6400 key 01
6406 key 81
6420 key 02
6426 key 82
6440 key 03
6446 key 83
6460 key 04
6466 key 84
7000 mark S06_VALUE_TYPED
7400 key 1C
7406 key 9C
8400 mark END_CLOSED
